# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/admin/Dockerfile is the repository ROOT.
# Anything listed here is never sent to the Docker daemon, so it can never end up in an image layer.

# --- secrets / local environment: NEVER in an image ---------------------------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
docker/.env.stack

# --- VCS / CI / editor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.github
.gitignore
.editorconfig
.vscode
.idea

# --- dependencies and build output are produced INSIDE the image, never copied from the host -------------------------
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo

# --- not needed to build the backend or the admin web app ----------------------------------------------------------
apps/mobile
infra
tools
docs
requiremnts.md
README.md
docker/*.yml
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
